<title>UK: UK 200 mln stg I/L bond tranche due 2003 exhausted.</title>
<headline>UK 200 mln stg I/L bond tranche due 2003 exhausted.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said a 200 million stg tap offer of 2.5 percent index-linked stock due 2003 was exhausted and no longer operating as a tranchette after the bonds were supplied finally at 179.00.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5109</p>
</text>
